  "source": "1 RCNY §103-14(c)(3) — building emissions limits by ENERGY STAR Portfolio Manager property type: (i) 2024–2029, (iii) 2030–2034, (iv) 2035–2039, (v) 2040–2049; (vi) 0.00 for all types from 2050. Multi-type limit per §103-14(d)(2)(ii), Equation 103-14.1: B = Σ lₖ·sₖ.",
